# Mechanic: Menace requires two blockers when the declaration is completed.
# Forcing: A large menace attacker safely attacks into two smaller blockers.
# AI behavior: Fleshgorger attacks for lethal without risking its own survival.
# Failure modes: A one-blocker completion must return to blocker selection.
# Card roles: Fleshgorger attacks; two different creatures make each block explicit.
# Shock verifies playable priority after legal combat damage.
# Protocol path: DeclareBlockersReq deltas, SubmitBlockersReq, renewed selection.
